 "intro_html": "The bowl: big shrimp, spicy mayo and store-bought pickled ginger on <a href=\"sushi-rice.html\">sushi rice</a>. The shrimp are dry-brined, then <b>started in cold water</b> and lifted out the moment they turn pink. That gentle heat keeps them pink, plump and juicy. Prefer them pan-cooked in a marinade? Two versions are below: garlic–ginger, or soy + sesame oil.",
